CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1792653488
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARosenberg: US diplomatic push offers
OL,4,Alittle hope for imminent Ukraine peace
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Oslo, the idea of a trilateral
OL,7,Fmeeting at leaders' level was floated.
OL,8,FThe hope was that Steve Witkoff's trip
OL,9,Fto Russia would pave the way for
OL,10,FPresident Vladimir Putin, Zelensky and
OL,11,FTrump to meet and agree an end to the
OL,12,Ffighting.
OL,14,FBut Putin has shown little desire to
OL,15,Fshare a table with Zelensky - unless
OL,16,Fthat table is in Moscow.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
